## Changed

- Made a terminated one-attempt system-media source terminally disposed, suppressing late lines and preventing a second scope-cleanup disposal.
- Made a natural socket close complete its connection effect so connection listener/fiber finalizers no longer wait for server shutdown.
- Added poll-deadline versioning: an authoritative state update invalidates an in-flight polling deadline before it samples.

Files touched: `packages/music-core/system-media.ts`, `packages/music-core/session/server.ts`, `packages/music-core/session/coordinator.ts`.

